{"language":"en","values":[["/names/cn","噜噜"],["/names/en","Lumont"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名英勇的坦克，善于承担伤害和冲锋陷阵。"],["/description_i18n/en","A courageous Tank who is skilled at absorbing damage and melee combat."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","噜噜，不会后退……"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Lumont won't retreat."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","噜噜要画一幅新画来纪念！"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Lumont will paint a picture for this moment!"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","向前，向前，冲啊——"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Forward charge!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","可以，回家了吗……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","Can Lumont... go home now...?"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","噜噜只是，冲在了前头……"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Lumont will charge ahead!"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","噜噜不怕冲锋，但噜噜更喜欢画画"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_i18n/en","Heh, Lumont isn't scared of the front lines!"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","我，我画，我的画，什么。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Huh... hah, no don't... hah, I? Oh, it's just a dream! Huh!"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","哦，没有坡，这里需要补一点颜色了，还有这里，哦。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Eh, eh... too much sand! Lumont need a bath..."],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","好多沙子，该洗澡了…"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","It's still pretty sturdy... hm, just needs some more paint. Over here, too..."],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","哇！心心念念的礼物，你太好了！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/en","Very generous! Lumont has been after this for a while now!"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","谢谢……噜噜收到礼物已经很开心了。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/en","Many thanks! Lumont is thrilled to accept this gift."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","这里画上花瓣……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/en","I'll draw some petals here..."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","有点暗，看不清"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/en","It's a bit too dark to see clearly."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","噜噜想吃饼干！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/en","I want some cookies!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","白色的，是雪吗？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Is that white... snow falling?"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","节日，快乐，礼物！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Festival, joy, and gift!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","可爱的，怪兽！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/en","That's one adorable monster!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","焰火，真好看！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/en","These fireworks are beautiful."],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","噜噜身材高大，但画的画里面的东西都很小。"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/en","Despite Lumont's enormous size, his paintings are always incredibly small and intricate."],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","噜噜生性害羞，不善言辞。如果你跟他问好，他只会以背影回应你。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/en","Bashful and bad at making conversation, Lumont is known to turn his back on anyone who greets him."],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","噜噜喜欢做手工。手那么大，手工那么小，真不知道他怎么做到的。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/en","Lumont enjoys making handicrafts. No one knows how someone with such large hands can create such small and exquisite designs."],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","噜噜生性善良，即使你说他的坏话，他也只会自己难过。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/en","Lumont is kind-hearted by nature. Even if you bad-mouth him, he will only feel bad about himself in secret."],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","噜噜头上的角也可以用来攻击，但是他不好意思和别人靠得太近。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/en","Lumont's horn is lethal and can be used as a weapon, and with his bashful nature, he doesn't want to get too close to anyone in case he hurts them by accident."],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","噜噜会去绿洲寻找植物，装饰在自己做的花瓶里。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/en","Lumont would often go to the oasis to find flowers to decorate the vases he made."],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","噜噜洗涂装的颜料桶时，会小心让废水不要污染草地。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/en","When Lumont washes his paint bucket, he is careful to keep the waste water from harming the local environment."],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","噜噜希望有朝一日，自己的设计能被世人认同。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/en","Lumont hopes to display his designs to the entire world someday and will show his handicrafts to everyone he meets. \"That big fella is too good for this world,\" said Odie when he passed through, looking for snakebone grass."],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","噜噜制造的武器很强，但伤害他人并不是他的本意，对他夸赞武器的威力会让他有些难过。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/en","Despite not wanting to hurt anyone, Lumont's handcrafted weapons are incredibly powerful. But whenever anyone compliments their strength, he cannot help but feel somewhat sad."],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","“比起战士，他更适合当个匠人。”噜噜的家人曾经摇着头这么说。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/en","\"He'd make a better craftsman than a warrior, that's for sure.\"—Lumont's family members, as they shook their heads."],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","说到吃的话，沙漠里的旅人树果还不错……噜噜呢？有爱吃的食物吗？"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/en","Speaking of food, the wanderfruit growing in the desert is quite tasty... Lumont, what do you like to eat?"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11411050.json"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/en","locales/en/ep1/herohub_story/11411050.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","满满 & 噜噜 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/en","Chippy & Lumont & Hammie"],["/interaction_records/0/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","荒角沙漠"],["/interaction_records/0/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Ashen Wastes"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","如果风暴要来，最好戴一条头巾。"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/en","It's better to put on a headscarf if you see a sandstorm coming."],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11411140.json"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/en","locales/en/ep1/herohub_story/11411140.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","噜噜"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/en","Lumont"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","为什么，盯着噜噜？"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/en","Why are you looking at me?"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415708.json"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415708.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","噜噜 & 戈丹"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/en","Lumont & Kordan"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","这里加一点红色……这里的地面上，再加上很多红色的花！"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/en","Add some red here... And add more red flowers right there on the ground!"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415017.json"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415017.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","噜噜 & 布鲁特斯"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/en","Lumont & Brutus"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","这里画上花瓣……"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/en","I'll draw some petals here..."],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415072.json"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415072.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","噜噜"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/en","Lumont"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","噜噜想吃饼干！"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/en","I want some cookies!"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415073.json"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415073.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","噜噜"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/en","Lumont"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","白色的，是雪吗？"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/en","Is that white... snow falling?"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415381.json"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415381.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","噜噜"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/en","Lumont"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","节日，快乐，礼物！"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/en","Festival, joy, and gift!"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415382.json"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415382.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","噜噜"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/en","Lumont"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","可爱的，怪兽！"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/en","That's one adorable monster!"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415553.json"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415553.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","噜噜"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/en","Lumont"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","焰火，真好看！"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/en","These fireworks are beautiful."],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415554.json"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415554.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","噜噜"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/en","Lumont"]]}